{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772894967,"nonce":"hUEOrrjGj4maIl22232+9T6AqjI=","title":"agent-commit sends worktree dir name as repo_id instead of main repo name","message":"agent-commit uses `basename $(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)` which in a worktree returns the worktree directory name (e.g. `feature__audit-fixes`) not the repo name (`mandible`). Use `basename $(dirname $(git rev-parse --git-common-dir))` to get the main repo root basename. Bug: stored session_issues and session_projects with branch names as repo_id, causing cross-ref navigation failures.","files":null}]}